{%- comment -%}
  17-10 Mirea · arranque de la portada: deja claro qué vendemos nada más entrar.
  Titular + 2 botones (Desde Corea / Desde España) + línea de confianza.
  18-10: sin franja negra (la confianza va en una línea suave bajo los botones) y fila de iconos redondos
  tipo Primor (bloque "acceso": foto del producto elegido, o del primer producto con stock de la colección).
  26-10: el buscador grande sale de la columna derecha → barra fina encima de los iconos.
  En su sitio: carrusel de banners por temporada (bloque "Banner promo"), con fechas de inicio/fin
  (AAAA-MM-DD) y opción "Mostrar siempre". Si ningún banner está activo, salen 2 banners de reserva.
  Ojo: Shopify guarda las páginas en caché, así que un cambio de fecha puede tardar un rato en verse.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign hoy = 'now' | date: '%Y%m%d' | plus: 0
  assign activos = 0
  assign hay_accesos = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'acceso'
      assign hay_accesos = true
    elsif block.type == 'promo'
      assign ini = block.settings.inicio | strip | remove: '-' | plus: 0
      assign fin = block.settings.fin | strip | remove: '-' | plus: 0
      if fin == 0
        assign fin = 99999999
      endif
      if block.settings.siempre or hoy >= ini and hoy <= fin
        assign activos = activos | plus: 1
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  if activos == 0
    assign total = 2
  else
    assign total = activos
  endif
-%}
<section class="mpt" id="mpt-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="mpt__wrap">
    <div class="mpt__copy">
      {%- if section.settings.antetitulo != blank -%}<p class="mpt__ante">{{ section.settings.antetitulo }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="mpt__title">{{ section.settings.titulo }}</h2>
      <div class="mpt__btns">
        {%- if section.settings.boton_1 != blank -%}<a class="mpt__btn mpt__btn--dark" href="{{ section.settings.enlace_1 }}">{{ section.settings.boton_1 }}</a>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.boton_2 != blank -%}<a class="mpt__btn mpt__btn--line" href="{{ section.settings.enlace_2 }}">{{ section.settings.boton_2 }}</a>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <ul class="mpt__trust list-unstyled">
        {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
          {%- assign k = 'confianza_' | append: i -%}
          {%- if section.settings[k] != blank -%}<li>{{ section.settings[k] }}</li>{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mps" id="mps-{{ section.id }}" role="region" aria-roledescription="carrusel" aria-label="Novedades y promociones Mirea" data-intervalo="{{ section.settings.intervalo | times: 1000 }}">
      <div class="mps__track">
        {%- if activos > 0 -%}
          {%- assign n = 0 -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type != 'promo' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign ini = block.settings.inicio | strip | remove: '-' | plus: 0
              assign fin = block.settings.fin | strip | remove: '-' | plus: 0
              if fin == 0
                assign fin = 99999999
              endif
              assign ver = false
              if block.settings.siempre or hoy >= ini and hoy <= fin
                assign ver = true
              endif
            -%}
            {%- if ver -%}
              {%- render 'mirea-promo-slide',
                indice: n, total: total,
                imagen: block.settings.imagen, imagen_movil: block.settings.imagen_movil,
                antetitulo: block.settings.antetitulo, titulo: block.settings.titulo, texto: block.settings.texto,
                boton: block.settings.boton, enlace: block.settings.enlace,
                fondo: block.settings.fondo, color: block.settings.color_texto,
                tema: block.settings.tema,
                atributos: block.shopify_attributes
              -%}
              {%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- comment -%} Reserva: banners fijos si no hay ninguno activo. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- render 'mirea-promo-slide', indice: 0, total: 2,
            imagen: images['Imagen_de_ChatGPT_28_sept_2026_12_53_18.png'],
            antetitulo: '🇰🇷 Desde Corea', titulo: 'K-beauty original de Corea.',
            texto: 'Las marcas que buscas, directas de Corea del Sur.',
            boton: 'Productos coreanos', enlace: '/collections/desde-corea',
            fondo: '#352b30', color: '#fcf7f3' -%}
          {%- render 'mirea-promo-slide', indice: 1, total: 2,
            imagen: images['ChatGPT_Image_20_sept_2026_15_00_31.png'],
            antetitulo: 'Envío gratis', titulo: 'Envío gratis en España desde 69 €.',
            texto: 'En tarifas elegibles. Pago seguro y seguimiento de tu pedido.',
            boton: 'Ver envíos', enlace: '/pages/envios-y-devoluciones',
            fondo: '#fcf7f3', color: '#352b30' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- comment -%}
        28-10 · Vista previa de temporada: los banners con "tema" que hoy NO tocan van guardados en <template>
        (no se ven ni se leen). Con ?mirea_tema=black_friday (o halloween, navidad, rebajas) en la URL,
        el JavaScript pone ese banner el primero. Solo cambia lo que se ve en ese navegador.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type != 'promo' or block.settings.tema == blank or block.settings.tema == 'ninguno' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign ini = block.settings.inicio | strip | remove: '-' | plus: 0
          assign fin = block.settings.fin | strip | remove: '-' | plus: 0
          if fin == 0
            assign fin = 99999999
          endif
          assign ver = false
          if block.settings.siempre or hoy >= ini and hoy <= fin
            assign ver = true
          endif
        -%}
        {%- unless ver -%}
          <template class="mps__tpl" data-tema="{{ block.settings.tema }}">
            {%- render 'mirea-promo-slide',
              indice: 99, total: total,
              imagen: block.settings.imagen, imagen_movil: block.settings.imagen_movil,
              antetitulo: block.settings.antetitulo, titulo: block.settings.titulo, texto: block.settings.texto,
              boton: block.settings.boton, enlace: block.settings.enlace,
              fondo: block.settings.fondo, color: block.settings.color_texto,
              tema: block.settings.tema
            -%}
          </template>
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      <div class="mps__nav"{% if total < 2 %} hidden{% endif %}>
          <button type="button" class="mps__arrow mps__prev" aria-label="Banner anterior"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 6-6 6 6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
          <div class="mps__dots"></div>
          <button type="button" class="mps__arrow mps__next" aria-label="Banner siguiente"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
          <button type="button" class="mps__arrow mps__play" aria-label="Pausar el carrusel" aria-pressed="false">
            <svg class="mps__i-pause" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 5h3v14H7zM14 5h3v14h-3z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            <svg class="mps__i-play" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if section.settings.mostrar_buscador -%}
    <div class="mpt__searchbar">
      <form action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search" class="mpt__form">
        <input type="hidden" name="options[prefix]" value="last">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="mpt-q-{{ section.id }}">Buscar productos, marcas o ingredientes</label>
        <svg class="mpt__lupa" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <input id="mpt-q-{{ section.id }}" type="search" name="q" placeholder="{{ section.settings.buscador | escape }}" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit">Buscar</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if hay_accesos -%}
    <div class="mpt__icons">
      <ul class="list-unstyled">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type != 'acceso' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign c = block.settings.coleccion
            assign img = blank
            if block.settings.producto != blank and block.settings.producto.featured_image
              assign img = block.settings.producto.featured_image
            elsif c != blank
              for p in c.products limit: 20
                if p.available and p.featured_image
                  assign img = p.featured_image
                  break
                endif
              endfor
              if img == blank
                assign img = c.image
              endif
            endif
            assign href = block.settings.enlace | default: c.url
          -%}
          <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a href="{{ href }}">
              <span class="mpt__ic">{%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 180, height: 180, crop: 'center' | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.texto }}{%- endif -%}</span>
              <span class="mpt__il">{{ block.settings.texto }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>
<style>
#mpt-{{ section.id }}{background:#fff;color:#1f191c}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__wrap{width:min(calc(100% - 40px),1280px);margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,36px) 0 clamp(14px,2vw,22px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr);gap:clamp(20px,4vw,56px);align-items:center}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__ante{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8f5d6c}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__title{margin:0;font-family:"Cormorant Garamond","Iowan Old Style",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.01em}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__btns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,color .2s}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__btn--dark{background:#1f191c;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid #1f191c}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__btn--dark:hover{background:#8f5d6c;border-color:#8f5d6c}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__btn--line{background:#fff;color:#1f191c;border:1.5px solid #1f191c}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__btn--line:hover{background:#1f191c;color:#fff}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__trust li{font-size:12.5px;color:#6f6468}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__trust li+li::before{content:"·";margin-right:18px;color:#c9b8bd}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__trust li+li{display:inline-flex}
/* Buscador fino encima de los iconos */
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__searchbar{width:min(calc(100% - 40px),640px);margin:4px auto 16px}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e1cbc6;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 3px 3px 16px;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form:focus-within{border-color:#925b6d;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(146,91,109,.15)}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__lupa{flex:0 0 auto;color:#715b63}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form input[type=search]{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:9px 0;color:#352b30}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form input[type=search]::placeholder{color:#7a6870;opacity:1}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form button{flex:0 0 auto;height:38px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:#352b30;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form button:hover,#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form button:focus-visible{background:#925b6d}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__icons{border-top:1px solid #f0e6e3;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6e3}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__icons ul{display:flex;gap:clamp(14px,2vw,26px);overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 20px 16px;width:max-content;max-width:100%}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__icons ul::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__icons li{flex:0 0 auto}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__icons a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:84px;color:#1f191c;text-decoration:none;text-align:center}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__ic{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6dcdf;display:block;transition:border-color .2s}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__ic img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transform:scale(1.15);margin:0;max-width:none}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__icons a:hover .mpt__ic{border-color:#1f191c}
#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__il{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.25}
/* Carrusel de banners */
#mps-{{ section.id }}{position:relative;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:#352b30;isolation:isolate}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__track{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/11}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--f);color:var(--c);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .9s ease,visibility 0s linear .9s;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide.is-active{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transition:opacity .9s ease,visibility 0s;z-index:1}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__media,#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__img{object-fit:cover;object-position:center;transform:scale(1.02);will-change:transform}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide.is-active .mps__img{animation:mpsKen-{{ section.id }} 9s ease-out forwards}
@keyframes mpsKen-{{ section.id }}{from{transform:scale(1.02)}to{transform:scale(1.1)}}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,var(--f92) 0%,var(--f92) 30%,var(--f55) 58%,var(--f0) 82%)}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__copy{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,34px) clamp(20px,3vw,34px) 64px;max-width:34em}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__ante{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.92}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__title{margin:0;font-family:"Cormorant Garamond","Iowan Old Style",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,40px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.01em}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__text{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:16px;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--c);color:var(--f);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s,opacity .2s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);opacity:.92}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide.is-active .mps__copy>*{animation:mpsUp-{{ section.id }} .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide.is-active .mps__copy>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.08s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide.is-active .mps__copy>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.16s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide.is-active .mps__copy>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.24s}
@keyframes mpsUp-{{ section.id }}{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:14px;bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);color:#352b30;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__arrow{width:30px;height:30px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:inherit;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__arrow:hover{background:#f3e9e6}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__dots{display:flex;align-items:center}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__dot{width:22px;height:30px;border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__dot span{display:block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:999px;background:#c9b3ba;transition:width .3s,background .3s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__dot.is-active span{width:18px;background:#925b6d}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__i-play{display:none}
#mps-{{ section.id }}.is-paused .mps__i-play{display:block}
#mps-{{ section.id }}.is-paused .mps__i-pause{display:none}
#mps-{{ section.id }} button:focus-visible,#mps-{{ section.id }} a:focus-visible,#mpt-{{ section.id }} .mpt__form button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #925b6d;outline-offset:2px}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__btn:focus-visible{outline-color:var(--c)}
/* 28-10 · Decoración por temporada (solo adorno: aria-hidden, sin clics, no tapa el texto) */
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__copy{z-index:2}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__deco{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__deco *{pointer-events:none}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide:not(.is-active) .mps__deco *{animation-play-state:paused}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__glow{position:absolute;inset:0}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__tag{position:absolute;top:18px;left:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1}
/* Halloween */
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide--halloween .mps__ante{color:#ff9a3c;opacity:1}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide--halloween .mps__btn{background:#f28c28;color:#1a1215}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide--halloween .mps__btn:focus-visible{outline-color:#f28c28}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__deco--halloween .mps__glow{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 4%,rgba(255,128,30,.34),transparent 46%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 6% 0%,rgba(128,60,180,.38),transparent 52%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 120%,rgba(90,30,120,.35),transparent 60%);animation:mpsGlow-{{ section.id }} 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes mpsGlow-{{ section.id }}{from{opacity:.75}to{opacity:1}}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__web{position:absolute;top:0;width:clamp(84px,13vw,128px);height:auto;color:rgba(255,244,235,.42)}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__web--l{left:0}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__web--r{right:0;transform:scaleX(-1)}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__spider{position:absolute;top:0;right:clamp(54px,8vw,86px);display:block;animation:mpsSpider-{{ section.id }} 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate;transform-origin:50% 0}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__spider::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:20px;width:1px;height:260px;background:rgba(255,244,235,.45)}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__spider svg{display:block;position:relative}
@keyframes mpsSpider-{{ section.id }}{from{transform:translateY(18px) rotate(-2deg)}to{transform:translateY(70px) rotate(2deg)}}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat{position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;display:block;animation:mpsBat-{{ section.id }} var(--bd,18s) linear infinite;animation-delay:var(--bdl,0s)}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat svg{display:block;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(255,140,40,.35));animation:mpsFlap-{{ section.id }} .9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat--1{top:16%;--bd:17s;--bdl:-3s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat--2{top:27%;--bd:23s;--bdl:-12s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat--2 svg{width:24px;height:11px}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat--3{top:9%;--bd:28s;--bdl:-19s}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__bat--3 svg{width:20px;height:9px;opacity:.85}
@keyframes mpsBat-{{ section.id }}{0%{transform:translate3d(-12%,0,0)}50%{transform:translate3d(48%,-14px,0)}100%{transform:translate3d(108%,6px,0)}}
@keyframes mpsFlap-{{ section.id }}{from{transform:scaleY(1)}to{transform:scaleY(.55) translateY(2px)}}
/* Black Friday */
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide--black_friday .mps__ante{color:#e6c766;opacity:1}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide--black_friday .mps__title{color:#f5e3ad;position:relative;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;padding-right:4px}
#mps-{{ section.id }} .mps__slide--black_friday .mps__title::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:-20%;bottom:-20%;left:0;width:35%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,240,200,.55),transparent);transform:translateX(-120%) skewX(-18deg);animation:mpsShine-{{ section.id }} 4.5s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes mpsShine-{{ section.id }}{0%,55%{transform:translateX(-120%) skewX(-18deg)}100%{transform:translateX(320%) skewX(-18deg)}}
